troller Support"},{"id":56,"description":"DualShock Controller Support"},{"id":57,"description":"DualSense Controller Support"},{"id":58,"description":"DualSense Controller Support"},{"id":18,"description":"Partial Controller Support"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":44,"description":"Remote Play Together"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}]}},"content":{"status":"success","steamAppId":"2475460","steamName":"SOS OPS!","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2475460/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T08:38:50.503846+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"SOS OPS! is more than a game. Your task is to save the city. You will find yourself in the epicenter of madness, where co-op missions with friends will raise the adrenaline to the limit!","detailedDescription":"SOS OPS! is a co-op chaos game about saving a city, where you and your friends turn every mission into absolute madness.\n\nMAJOR UPDATE: PvP MODE\n\nA brand-new way to ruin friendships.\nPick an arena on the in-game computer and jump straight into the fight.\nSet the rules by yourself: time limit, kill goal, infinite mode, gear spawn rate.\nWeapons & power-ups spawn on the map and then you lose them on death.\n5 arenas to start: Volcano Crater, SOS Factory, Flight 747, Pyramid, Tower\n\nYou’re a team of emergency responders.\n\nIn practice, that means you’re at least trying to be one.\n\nSomeone’s putting out a fire, someone’s carrying a cat, someone accidentally drops a teammate off a roof, and someone else has no idea what the objective is — but they’re doing their best. \n\nPhysics is the thing you’ll either love us for or absolutely hate us for.\n\nIt breaks plans, creates ridiculous situations, and turns even the simplest actions into a chain of failures, shouting (and sometimes… victories). \n\nNo boring tutorials. No tedious tasks.\n\nThis game was made by ADHD people, for ADHD people. Just fast-paced missions, constant movement, and a lot of falling over.\n\nGrab a team of up to 4 players and dive into the city chaos, where success isn’t measured by completed levels — but by how loud you’re laughing.","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/a0a7b4a2b2526ae76cab0f0ba6e87e63d962c1a7/header.jpg?t=1791094099"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/5344dee4abc51a44a5ff48fe7e4508187f885f6f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1791094099"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/99d1f93eca12349c8f44bd0636e3b294643a366b/ss_99d1f93eca12349c8f44bd0636e3b294643a366b.600x338.jpg?t=1791094099","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/99d1f93eca12349c8f44bd0636e3b294643a366b/ss_99d1f93eca12349c8f44bd0636e3b294643a366b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791094099"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/efd67f52bc97b090cc3a4673dc4ffaa2e3aba1f1/ss_efd67f52bc97b090cc3a4673dc4ffaa2e3aba1f1.600x338.jpg?t=1791094099","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/efd67f52bc97b090cc3a4673dc4ffaa2e3aba1f1/ss_efd67f52bc97b090cc3a4673dc4ffaa2e3aba1f1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791094099"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/6386fdd9ceb5eeab879bda5b5c7dd4e53082c1a0/ss_6386fdd9ceb5eeab879bda5b5c7dd4e53082c1a0.600x338.jpg?t=1791094099","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/6386fdd9ceb5eeab879bda5b5c7dd4e53082c1a0/ss_6386fdd9ceb5eeab879bda5b5c7dd4e53082c1a0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791094099"},{"id":3,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/c04